         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nWe have already learned that subtraction is a process of return: it undoes addition. On the Yupana, this means reversing the movements we use to add.\n\nIn this class, we will review the movements of the *Yupana Inka Tawa Pukllay* method and perform them in the opposite direction. Subtraction on the Yupana is called *T'aqay*, or parallel subtraction.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "256dd146-84e1-498f-bef3-aeea246f2d83",
