         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Inverse ISKAY\n\nIn addition, the *ISKAY* movement splits two markers on square 2 into squares 1 and 3. In subtraction, we reverse it: with a marker on square 3 (value 3), to subtract 1 the inverse movement splits the 3 into squares 1 and 2, then removes the 1. This represents:\n\n3 − 1 = 2",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p data-custom=\"reverse-iskay\"></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
