         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Inverse KIMSA\n\nIn addition, the *KIMSA* movement splits two markers on square 3 into squares 1 and 5. In subtraction, we reverse it: with a marker on square 5 (value 5), to subtract 1 the inverse movement splits the 5 into squares 1 and 3, then removes the extra 1. This represents:\n\n5 − 1 = 4",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
