         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Inverse PISQA\n\nWe use the inverse *PISQA* movement when a marker is on the upper line (value 10) and we need to subtract 5. Bring the marker down as a single marker on square 5 of the current line. This represents:\n\n10 − 5 = 5",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
