                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Inverse PICHANA\n\nIn addition, the *PICHANA* movement sweeps markers together from squares 1 and 2 into square 3. In subtraction, we reverse it: with a marker on square 3 (value 3), subtract 2; with a marker on square 2 (value 2), subtract 1. The inverse movement splits the marker and removes the extra part. This represents:\n\n3 − 2 = 1\n\n2 − 1 = 1",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p data-custom=\"reverse-pichana\"></p>",
