                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Cancellation\n\nAn important concept in Yupana subtraction is **cancellation**. When two markers of the same value meet — one to add and one to subtract — they cancel each other out. Any number subtracted from itself equals zero.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p data-custom=\"reverse-cancellation\"></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
