         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this class, we learned to subtract on the Yupana by reversing the addition movements.\n\nWe use the Yupana differently from other abacuses, yet we reach the same result: the tools differ, but the central idea is the same.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
